# Two-repo layout

This workspace is a local folder with `frontend/` and `backend/`. They are **separate git repositories**. Do not commit or push from the parent `niatawards` folder.

| Local folder | Remote |
|---|---|
| `frontend/` | https://github.com/kammari-venkatesh/niatawards-frontend.git |
| `backend/` | https://github.com/kammari-venkatesh/niatawards-backend.git |

When committing or pushing:

- Frontend changes: run git in `frontend/`
- Backend changes: run git in `backend/`
- Never mix both in one commit
- Never push to `Valiniat/niat-awards` unless asked

Keep `.env` out of git in both repos. Use `.env.example` for placeholders only.
